  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;DR. SOPHIA PATEL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Sophia Patel is a researcher who is impressed by her colleague Anderson Diaz-Perez and is currently visiting the South China Institute of Environmental Sciences."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0430</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANDERSON DIAZ-PEREZ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Anderson Diaz-Perez is a colleague of Dr. Sophia Patel known for his meticulous attention to detail and passion for environmental conservation, and he has worked on several projects with her."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0430</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GUANGZHOU&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Guangzhou is a city where Dr. Sophia Patel is visiting, characterized by its humid climate and bustling streets."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0430</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOUTH CHINA INSTITUTE OF ENVIRONMENTAL SCIENCES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The South China Institute of Environmental Sciences is a prestigious research institute where Dr. Sophia Patel is visiting, known for its groundbreaking work in environmental sciences."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0430</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. LI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Li is the director of the South China Institute of Environmental Sciences and greets Dr. Sophia Patel upon her arrival."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0430</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HAINAN ISLAND&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Hainan Island is the site of a research project involving Anderson Diaz-Perez and Dr. Sophia Patel, focusing on the impact of coastal development on mangrove ecosystems."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0430</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SCIES TEAM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The SCIES Team is a group of researchers led by Anderson Diaz-Perez and Dr. Sophia Patel, working on a project in Hainan Island in 2018."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0430</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MANGROVE ECOSYSTEMS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mangrove Ecosystems are the focus of the research conducted by the SCIES Team on Hainan Island, studying the impact of coastal development."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0430</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CORPORACIÓN UNIVERSITARIA RAFAEL NUÑEZ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Corporación Universitaria Rafael Nuñez is a Colombian university where Anderson Diaz-Perez has been affiliated and conducted research."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0430</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CARTAGENA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cartagena is a city in Colombia where Corporación Universitaria Rafael Nuñez is located and where Anderson Diaz-Perez has conducted research."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0430</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JOURNAL OF ENVIRONMENTAL STUDIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Journal of Environmental Studies is a publication where Anderson Diaz-Perez has co-authored a paper titled 'Innovative Approaches to Sustainable Development in Coastal Cities' with colleagues from Corporación Universitaria Rafael Nuñez."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0430</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DEPARTMENT OF ENVIRONMENTAL SCIENCES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Department of Environmental Sciences at Corporación Universitaria Rafael Nuñez is where Anderson Diaz-Perez is listed as a faculty member."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0430</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON SUSTAINABLE CITIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The International Conference on Sustainable Cities, held in Cartagena in 2018, is where Anderson Diaz-Perez presented a paper titled 'Climate Change Mitigation Strategies for Urban Planning' with affiliations to Corporación Universitaria Rafael Nuñez."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0430</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GUANGZHOU AIR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Guangzhou Air refers to the humid climate of Guangzhou, which affects Dr. Sophia Patel's experience."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0430</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STREET VENDORS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Street Vendors are mentioned as part of the bustling streets of Guangzhou, indicating the local market scene."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0430</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CYCLISTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cyclists are mentioned as part of the bustling streets of Guangzhou, indicating the local transportation scene."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0430</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JASMINE TEA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Jasmine Tea is served during the meeting between Dr. Sophia Patel and Dr. Li, indicating a traditional refreshment."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0430</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NONDESCRIPT BUILDING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The nondescript building is the headquarters of the South China Institute of Environmental Sciences, which is not particularly notable from the outside."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0430</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MANGROVE FORESTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mangrove Forests are the focus of the research conducted by the SCIES Team on Hainan Island, studying the impact of coastal development."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0430</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COASTAL DEVELOPMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Coastal Development is the factor studied by the SCIES Team in relation to the impact on mangrove ecosystems."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0430</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNCHECKED DEVELOPMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Unchecked Development is a scenario discussed by Dr. Sophia Patel and Dr. Li, which could lead to the loss of mangrove forests."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0430</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;30% LOSS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"30% Loss is the estimated percentage of mangrove forests that could be lost due to unchecked development within the next decade."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0430</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TROPICAL FOREST&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tropical Forest is the type of forest where the SCIES Team conducted their research in Hainan Island."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0430</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SCIES PROJECT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The SCIES Project is the research project conducted by the SCIES Team in Hainan Island in 2018."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0430</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SCIES RESEARCH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"SCIES Research is the ongoing research conducted by the SCIES Team on the impact of coastal development on mangrove ecosystems."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0430</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SCIES FINDINGS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"SCIES Findings are the results of the research conducted by the SCIES Team, suggesting the potential loss of mangrove forests due to unchecked development."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0430</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SCIES PAPER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"SCIES Paper is the co-authored paper by Dr. Sophia Patel and Anderson Diaz-Perez on the impact of coastal development on mangrove ecosystems."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0430</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ORCID ID&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"ORCID ID is a unique identifier for Anderson Diaz-Perez, used to track his academic contributions."</data>
